      "description": "The collaborative-development sub-graph — a NAMED SUB-GRAPH of this layer on the pattern of folio-assistant-core's `collab/`, and OPT-IN: off in every layer, this one included, unless that layer lists `folio-assistant-sci.collab` in its own `enableSubgraphs` (owner, 2026-11-13, check:optin-refs follow-up). It holds the paper process that runs on the work plan and the delivery process — it claims and closes a bean (cat-harness's `Process_BeanOpen` / `Process_BeanClose`) and names `bean-coordination` and `todo-manager` (cat-harness's `work-plan`): `authoring-a-paper.bpmn`, with its checklist, SVG and the decision table it evaluates (`decisions/lean-build-gate.dmn`). It `requires` `cat-harness.sdlc`, which requires `cat-harness.work-plan`, so switching it on switches both on. The graphs inside it are declared FROM WITHIN, in `collab/graph.json`.",
